..!interpreter english translate noabbrev
..*****************************************************************************
.. FOP-Name      : PACKSYS.EV
.. Autor         : fwester
.. Verantwortlich: cl
.. Kontrolle     : lei
.. Funktion      : Behandelt die Feldaustrittsereignisse der Eingabefelder.
.. Ablauf        : Zentrales EFOP
..
.. Functionality : Handles field exit events of the input parameters.
.. Program flow  : Central efop
..*****************************************************************************
.set trans -
..------------------------------- Header --------------------------------------
.continue DETAILS ? G|evtartengl = "FIELD_EXIT" & G|evtvar = "kpaket"
.continue DETAILS ? G|evtartengl = "FIELD_EXIT" & G|evtvar = "karb"
.continue DETAILS ? G|evtartengl = "FIELD_EXIT" & G|evtvar = "krichtung"
.continue DETAILS ? G|evtartengl = "FIELD_FILL" & G|evtvar = "keinschl"
..------------------------------- Table  --------------------------------------
..=============================================================================
.continue END
..
!DETAILS: set details
.copy M|detailpaket = M|kpaket
.select screen header
.input 'M|rowdetails'
.continue CLRTAB
..
!CLRTAB
.. clear table
.make screen line -- ? M|tzeilen > 0
..*****************************************************************************
!END
.continue
